WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.784
The Previous scene and Next scene buttons move you

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:06.573
through the learning The contents menu lets you revisit

00:00:06.586 --> 00:00:10.310
a topic You can play pause or replay the

00:00:10.349 --> 00:00:13.889
narration When a card or an answer option has

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:16.323
a play symbol you can select it to hear

00:00:16.402 --> 00:00:20.586
that particular explanation Listening to an option does not

00:00:20.665 --> 00:00:22.073
select it as your answer
